jonquil
------------------------------------------
Bringing TOML blooms to JSON land

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgfortran5-14.4.0-1
  libjonquil-devel-0.3.2-1bl1
  libjonquil0-0.3.2-1bl1
  libtoml-f-devel-0.5.2-1bl1
  libtoml-f0-0.5.2-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-fortran-14.4.0-1
  libtest-drive-devel-0.6.1-1bl1
  libtoml-f-devel-0.5.2-1bl1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/toml-f/jonquil

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/toml-f/jonquil/archive/refs/tags/v0.3.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack jonquil-0.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./jonquil-0.3.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/jonquil-0.3.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/jonquil-0.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libjonquil0-0.3.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libjonquil-devel-0.3.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

